<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post1143470226399818447..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: Mitt Romney and the Teen Torture Industry</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1143470226399818447/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/06/mitt-romney-and-teen-torture-industry.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>25</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8711339503877921627</id><published>2014-06-10T13:07:08.199-06:00</published><updated>2014-06-10T13:07:08.199-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Thank you for trying to shine some light on this d...</title><content type='html'>Thank you for trying to shine some light on this dark subject. It seems still very few are aware of this. How a modern civilized country can allow the torture of it&amp;#39;s children like this is just beyond me.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1143470226399818447/comments/default/8711339503877921627'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1143470226399818447/comments/default/8711339503877921627'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/06/mitt-romney-and-teen-torture-industry.html?showComment=1402427228199#c8711339503877921627' title=''/><author><name>Yukon Cornileus</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/17231928636110856136</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='//lh5.googleusercontent.com/-BIyLNEK6wrc/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAABo/pRofqJ9CQ6M/s512-c/photo.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/06/mitt-romney-and-teen-torture-industry.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1143470226399818447' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1143470226399818447' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1461645421"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 10, 2014 at 1:07 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-459621162801233868</id><published>2009-10-10T11:39:28.467-06:00</published><updated>2009-10-10T11:39:28.467-06:00</updated><title type='text'>With this information, parents should take more ti...</title><content type='html'>With this information, parents should take more time in choosing the best treatment center and program to &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.helpfortroubledteens411.com&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;help for troubled teens&lt;/a&gt;. This step is very critical in the recovery of your troubled teens.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1143470226399818447/comments/default/459621162801233868'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1143470226399818447/comments/default/459621162801233868'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/06/mitt-romney-and-teen-torture-industry.html?showComment=1255196368467#c459621162801233868' title=''/><author><name>Charlene</name><uri>http://www.helpfortroubledteens411.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/06/mitt-romney-and-teen-torture-industry.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1143470226399818447' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1143470226399818447' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-162395211"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 10, 2009 at 11:39 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7532326104582713507</id><published>2009-09-28T23:51:50.143-06:00</published><updated>2009-09-28T23:51:50.143-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Troubled parents need to be very cautious in choos...</title><content type='html'>Troubled parents need to be very cautious in choosing an option for teenagers, as there are various types of &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.restoreteens.com/&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;troubled teens options&lt;/a&gt; choosing a specialized teen option with the help of professional educational consultant guidance is helpful.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1143470226399818447/comments/default/7532326104582713507'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/114347022639981