e='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1143470226399818447' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-266305293"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 25, 2007 at 9:16 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5663817258101885403</id><published>2007-06-25T18:51:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-06-25T18:51:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>This is a very important, but very disturbing, pos...</title><content type='html'>This is a very important, but very disturbing, post.  I&#39;ll bet that even the Marquis de Sade would be sickened by this.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1143470226399818447/comments/default/5663817258101885403'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1143470226399818447/comments/default/5663817258101885403'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/06/mitt-romney-and-teen-torture-industry.html?showComment=1182819060000#c5663817258101885403' title=''/><author><name>Andy</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/06/mitt-romney-and-teen-torture-industry.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1143470226399818447' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1143470226399818447' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 25, 2007 at 6:51 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5329023883956226335</id><published>2007-06-25T06:44:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-06-25T06:44:00.000-06:00</u